{"id":"overview","topic":"overview","title":"What Aqua does","terms":["aqua","purpose","overview","work","does"],"text":"Aqua turns a question about an authorized dataset into a read-only SQL query, result rows and a short summary. Generated statements stay internal; employees see their own answers and result tables. This help uses reviewed Aqua guidance; it does not query a dataset or train a model.","status":"active","reviewed":true,"supersedes":["overview-v0"]},
{"id":"questions","topic":"questions","title":"Ask a data question","terms":["ask","question","data","query","database","dataset","model"],"text":"Choose Ask data to prepare a question, then explicitly send it in the existing composer. State the measure, grouping and time range you need. Only current server-advertised models are selectable. Signing in does not by itself grant dataset access; Aqua checks access again when accepting and delivering analysis.","status":"active","reviewed":true,"supersedes":[]},
{"id":"results","topic":"results","title":"Read a result","terms":["result","rows","table","sql","truncated","precision","exact"],"text":"Review the returned table and its stated source, period and limitations. A limited or truncated result is not the complete dataset. Exact-value metadata preserves supported values that a browser number would change. Unknown units, aggregation or freshness stay unknown; a displayed result is not proof of current source freshness.","status":"active","reviewed":true,"supersedes":[]},
{"id":"charts","topic":"results","title":"Understand a chart","terms":["chart","charts","plot","visual","graph","visualization"],"text":"Charts visualize the returned result. Open the available visual controls to inspect them alongside the data table. A chart does not establish causation or a forecast, and cannot recover rows missing from a limited result. Automatic learned monthly trends are not offered by this help feature.","status":"active","reviewed":true,"supersedes":[]},
{"id":"history","topic":"overview","title":"Find chats and projects","terms":["history","chat","chats","projects","project","recents","search","archive"],"text":"Use Projects and Recents to find your own saved chats. Title search is explicit; it does not search every message body. Project folders load bounded pages on request. A saved chat belongs to its account, and access to saved analytical results still depends on current permissions.","status":"active","reviewed":true,"supersedes":[]},
{"id":"preferences","topic":"overview","title":"Change supported preferences","terms":["settings","preferences","preference","theme","language","save","appearance"],"text":"Open Settings from the account menu and use the supported controls. Account preferences use an explicit save with revision checks. If a newer saved version conflicts, reload and review it before saving again. Preferences cannot change permissions, server limits or model instructions.","status":"active","reviewed":true,"supersedes":[]},
{"id":"account","topic":"privacy","title":"Account and dataset access","terms":["account","access","permission","permissions","grant","signin","login","sign"],"text":"Account access and dataset permission are separate. An authenticated account without a dataset grant can use this help and its available account settings, but cannot submit data analysis. Signing out revokes the server session; an unresolved sign-out keeps private work hidden until its outcome is known.","status":"active","reviewed":true,"supersedes":[]},
{"id":"password","topic":"privacy","title":"Recover account access","terms":["password","forgot","reset","recover","recovery","email","mailbox"],"text":"Use Forgot password on the sign-in screen and follow the mailbox verification flow. A completed reset does not automatically sign you in or grant a dataset. Never paste a password, verification link, proof token or recovery code into a help question.","status":"active","reviewed":true,"supersedes":[]},
{"id":"privacy","topic":"privacy","title":"Help and private information","terms":["privacy","private","stored","memory","learning","learn","personal","delete","export"],"text":"This help searches only the reviewed guidance shipped with Aqua. It does not read result rows, saved conversations, company documents or arbitrary files, and it does not update model weights. Do not include secrets or private records in your question. Available export or deletion actions depend on the server's advertised capabilities; help cannot perform them.","status":"active","reviewed":true,"supersedes":[]}
